# Docker build context for the Java service images is the repository root, but the Dockerfiles only COPY the
# pre-built fat jars. Everything else is excluded to keep the context tiny and to keep secrets out of layers.
*
!services/*/target/*-1.0.0.jar
!gateway/target/*-1.0.0.jar
# (the frontend image has its own context: frontend/oms-ui, with its own .dockerignore)
